      "writtenOn": "2026-08-27T09:20:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "addDefGw() inserts the gateway MAC into staticNeighbors but never calls writeConfigurationFile(). However, the next unrelated config write  will iterate all staticNeighbors and persist this as a [Neighbor] section in the .network file. After that, the stale gateway MAC survives lease expiry, gateway changes, and reboots as a permanent static ARP entry — even though it was never user-configured.",
      "range": {
